itle": "Rajasthan CM Sharma congratulates Padma award winners from state", "url": "https://www.theweek.in/wire-updates/national/2025/01/26/nrg9-rj-cm-padma-awards.html"}]}, "The search results confirm Maharaj Kishan Bhan received the Padma Bhushan, but they don't state the year directly.\n\n- A Deccan Herald article reports that President Pranab Mukherjee on Saturday felicitated several eminent personalities, and lists Dr Maharaj Kishan Bhan, leading biomedical researcher among the Padma Bhushan awardees. The article's text contains no date.\n- The article's context suggests the year. It mentions that Social satirist Jaspal Singh Bhatti and actor Rajesh Khanna were given Padma Bhushan posthumously. From my own knowledge, not these results, those posthumous awards were in 2013, which would make Bhan's award 2013. I could not verify that from the search results, so please confirm it against the official Padma Awards list at padmaawards.gov.in.\n- For background, Bhan was a pediatrician and clinical scientist who was positioned as Secretary, Department of Biotechnology, Government of India, until 2012."], "durationSeconds": 7.8093671250000005, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_019MAPKz4NanmZgkz2WirvV4", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
