{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01FbH9yxicqdaRDBhz4j1SRX", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.biospectrumasia.com/article/pdf/4585\"}, {\"url\": \"https://biospectrumindia.com/news/66/15648/dr-maharaj-kishan-bhan-passes-away-at-72.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://biospectrumindia.com/article/pdf/15648\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.bharatpedia.org/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.biospectrumasia.com/influencers/26/4585/padma-bhushan-dr-mk-bhan-to-get-genome-valley-excellence-award-today.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.biospectrumasia.com/influencers/49/4585/padma-bhushan-dr-mk-bhan-to-get-genome-valley-excellence-award-today.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dailyrounds.org/blog/tag/dr-nk-bhan\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:35:00.736Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Maharaj Kishan Bhan pediatrician Padma Bhushan 2013 civil services", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_017eyoEcdjEC3ukzJ4GMZLaK", "content": [{"title": "Maharaj Kishan Bhan", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan"}, {"title": "www.biospectrumasia.com", "url": "https://www.biospectrumasia.com/article/pdf/4585"}, {"title": "Dr Maharaj Kishan Bhan passes away at 72", "url": "https://biospectrumindia.com/news/66/15648/dr-maharaj-kishan-bhan-passes-away-at-72.html"}, {"title": "biospectrumindia.com", "url": "https://biospectrumindia.com/article/pdf/15648"}, {"title": "Maharaj Kishan Bhan | |", "url": "https://en.bharatpedia.org/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan"}, {"title": "Maharaj Kishan Bhan", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/Maharaj_Kishan_Bhan"}, {"title": "Padma Bhushan Dr MK Bhan to get Genome Valley Excellence Award today", "url": "https://www.biospectrumasia.com/influencers/26/4585/padma-bhushan-dr-mk-bhan-to-get-genome-valley-excellence-award-today.html"}, {"title": "Padma Bhushan Dr MK Bhan to get Genome Valley Excellence Award today", "url": "https://www.biospectrumasia.com/influencers/49/4585/padma-bhushan-dr-mk-bhan-to-get-genome-valley-excellence-award-today.html"}, {"title": "dr nk bhan", "url": "https://dailyrounds.org/blog/tag/dr-nk-bhan"}]}, "Maharaj Kishan Bhan was an Indian pediatrician and clinical scientist who died in 2020. He received the Padma Bhushan in 2013, and one source lists it under the \"civil services\" heading.\n\n- **Padma Bhushan (2013):** Wikipedia lists the award as \"Padmabhushan for civil services - 2013\" in his awards list. A BioSpectrum article from January 2013 says he received it that week, and describes it as India's third-highest civilian award, after the Bharat Ratna and Padma Vibhushan, for his contributions to Indian science.\n- **Public service:** He was a former Secretary to the Government of India, Department of Biotechnology, Ministry of Science & Technology. One obituary says he played a key role in the establishment of many new Institutes, clusters and innovation support agencies during roughly ten years in that post.\n- **Other roles:** Sources describe him as a National Science Professor at the Indian Institute of Technology, Delhi, ... President of JIPMER and an Advisor to the World Health Organization.\n- **Other awards:** He received the Shanti Swarup Bhatnagar Prize in 1990, which the highest science award in India, in the Medical Sciences category.\n- **Death:** He died on 26 January 2020, aged 72, after a battle with cancer for several months.\n\nThe sources agree on the 2013 Padma Bhushan. The \"civil services\" wording comes only from the Wikipedia listing, so it reflects how that list labels the award rather than a separate official category."], "durationSeconds": 6.864455416000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01FbH9yxicqdaRDBhz4j1SRX", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
